:name: nRF52840 nice!nano
:description: Bare-metal UART echo + LED, or (with $elf=$zephyr) the prebuilt Zephyr shell sample.
# Variables set by ./renode-box examples run: $ex_dir, $ex_out, $demos
$elf?=$ex_out/nicenano_hello.elf

using sysbus
mach create "nicenano"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/nicenano.repl
showAnalyzer uart0

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
"""
runMacro $reset
